      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剩余不到 1 分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A background helper" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个后台助手"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A backup to the per-agent setup: while Adrafinil is already keeping your Mac awake for one agent, it can also notice other known agents (like a second Claude Code) running without their hook installed. It only runs while an agent is already active — never a background scan — so it costs nothing while your Mac is idle or asleep." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作为逐个连接智能体的补充：当 Adrafinil 已在为某个智能体保持 Mac 唤醒时，它还能发现其他未安装钩子、但正在运行的已知智能体（例如第二个 Claude Code）。它只在已有智能体活跃时运行——从不在后台扫描——因此 Mac 闲置或睡眠时没有任何开销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A display hold is active but the lid is closed with no other display — the agent behind it can't see the screen." : {
      "comment" : "Daemon warning",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示器保持处于活跃状态，但盖子已合上且没有其他显示器——发起它的智能体看不到屏幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A menu bar app" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个菜单栏应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A newer version of Adrafinil is out. See what's new and install it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 有新版本了。查看新功能并安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A newer version of Adrafinil is ready when you are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 的新版本已就绪，随时可以安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A question, a plan approval, or a permission prompt stops the work until you answer — but the question can be answered from your phone with Remote Control, which needs the Mac awake to receive it. The grace period keeps it reachable exactly that long; if nobody answers, your Mac sleeps, and the moment the session resumes Adrafinil protects it again. The menu shows a countdown while it waits." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提问、计划审批或权限请求都会让工作暂停，直到你回应——但你可以用 Remote Control 在手机上作答，而这需要 Mac 保持唤醒才能收到。宽限期会让 Mac 在这段时间内保持可达；如果无人回应，Mac 就会睡眠，会话一旦恢复，Adrafinil 会再次接管。等待期间菜单中会显示倒计时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add these to your agent's start and stop hooks. Replace %@ with your agent's session-id variable, so each turn's acquire and release share a key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把以下命令添加到智能体的开始和停止钩子中。将 %@ 替换为智能体的会话 ID 变量，使每一轮的 acquire 和 release 使用同一个键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add your own agent" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加自定义智能体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds Adrafinil as an MCP tool in %@, so it can keep your Mac awake for work that runs past its reply." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将 Adrafinil 作为 MCP 工具添加到 %@，让它能为回复结束后仍在运行的工作保持 Mac 唤醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds Adrafinil as an MCP tool in %@, so the agent can keep your Mac awake for work that runs past its reply." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将 Adrafinil 作为 MCP 工具添加到 %@，让该智能体能为回复结束后仍在运行的工作保持 Mac 唤醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil" : {},
    "Adrafinil Setup" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 设置向导"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil checks GitHub Releases once a day and tells you here and in the menu when a new version is out. Nothing downloads or installs until you choose Update Now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 每天检查一次 GitHub Releases，有新版本时会在这里和菜单中提示你。在你选择“立即更新”之前，不会下载或安装任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil checks GitHub Releases once a day and verifies every download's code signature. Updates install themselves when your Mac is idle and no agents are being kept awake — or right away with Update Now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 每天检查一次 GitHub Releases，并校验每个下载文件的代码签名。更新会在 Mac 闲置且没有智能体需要保持唤醒时自动安装——也可以点“立即更新”马上安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil chime" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 提示音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil couldn't clean up everywhere — remove these by hand, or the agent will keep calling a command that no longer exists:\n\n%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 未能清理所有位置——请手动移除以下内容，否则智能体会一直调用一个已不存在的命令：\n\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil cue" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 提示音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil is paused — resume it first." : {
      "comment" : "Daemon hold refusal",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 已暂停——请先恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil is running from a temporary location (macOS translocation). Setting up from here would point everything at a path that disappears on the next launch. Move Adrafinil.app to your Applications folder, then open it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 正从临时位置运行（macOS 应用转移）。在这里设置会让所有配置指向一个下次启动就会消失的路径。请将 Adrafinil.app 移到“应用程序”文件夹，然后重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil is set up" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 已设置完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil isn't keeping your Mac awake" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 未在保持 Mac 唤醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil isn't set up" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 尚未设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil keeps it awake while your agents work — a desktop still sleeps on idle and would stall a long task. Lid and battery features are hidden because there's no lid or battery to manage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体工作时，Adrafinil 会让它保持唤醒——台式机闲置时仍会睡眠，可能中断耗时较长的任务。由于没有屏幕盖和电池，相关功能已隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil keeps your Mac awake — even with the lid closed — while your AI agents work." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 AI 智能体工作期间，Adrafinil 会让你的 Mac 保持唤醒——即使合上盖子也一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil kept your Mac awake" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 让你的 Mac 保持了唤醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil let it sleep to cool down%@. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Adrafinil let it sleep to cool down%1$@. %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 已让它睡眠降温%1$@。%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil let your Mac sleep to save power. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 已让你的 Mac 睡眠以节省电量。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil needs your approval" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 需要你的批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil updated itself at a quiet moment — here's what changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 已在空闲时自动更新——以下是更新内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil updated itself at a quiet moment. See what's new." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 已在空闲时自动更新。查看新功能。"
