        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents can't keep your Mac awake until you resume" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复之前，智能体无法让 Mac 保持唤醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents finished" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体已完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents that run as one shared background service, like Hermes, aren't picked up this way — connect them in the Agents tab so their hooks can signal when they're actually working." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以共享后台服务形式运行的智能体（例如 Hermes）无法通过这种方式发现——请在“智能体”标签页中连接它们，让它们的钩子在真正工作时发出信号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All set — Codex will keep your Mac awake while it works." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一切就绪——Codex 工作时会让 Mac 保持唤醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An agent can ask Adrafinil to keep your Mac awake for a background task it started — like a long build or deploy — even after it finishes replying. Every hold has a time limit and shows up in the menu, where you can end it yourself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体可以请求 Adrafinil 为它启动的后台任务（例如耗时较长的构建或部署）保持 Mac 唤醒，即使它已经回复完毕。每次保持都有时间上限，并会显示在菜单中，你可以随时手动结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve Adrafinil's two hooks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "批准 Adrafinil 的两个钩子"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back to presets" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "返回预设"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Background shell tasks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "后台 Shell 任务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery was running low" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电池电量过低"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU temperature is unreadable, so the thermal cutout can't trigger." : {
      "comment" : "Daemon warning",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取 CPU 温度，过热保护将无法触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't verify — trust it in Codex" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法验证——请在 Codex 中信任它"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check for updates" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking for updates…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在检查更新…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex needs you to trust its hooks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Codex 需要你信任它的钩子"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex only runs hooks you've approved. Until you trust Adrafinil's, Codex won't tell it when a turn starts or ends — so your Mac may sleep mid-task, or stay awake after Codex is done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Codex 只运行你批准过的钩子。在你信任 Adrafinil 的钩子之前，Codex 不会告诉它一轮对话何时开始或结束——因此 Mac 可能在任务中途睡眠，或在 Codex 完成后仍保持唤醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex won't run these hooks until you trust them. Open Codex, run “/hooks”, and approve Adrafinil's acquire and release entries — otherwise it can't tell when Codex is working." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你信任之前，Codex 不会运行这些钩子。打开 Codex，运行“/hooks”，并批准 Adrafinil 的 acquire 和 release 条目——否则它无法得知 Codex 何时在工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Config unreadable" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配置无法读取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect each agent so Adrafinil knows when it's working and keeps your Mac awake only then. Some agents can also keep it awake on their own — for a build or deploy that runs past their reply. You can change all of this later in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接每个智能体，让 Adrafinil 知道它何时在工作，并只在那时保持 Mac 唤醒。部分智能体还能自行保持唤醒——用于回复结束后仍在运行的构建或部署。这些都可以稍后在设置中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect your agents" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接你的智能体"
          }
        }
      }
