            "value" : "集成方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It has hooks / events" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "支持钩子 / 事件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It has no hooks — wrap the command" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不支持钩子——包装命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It needs your approval to run in the background. Tap to open Login Items & Extensions, then turn Adrafinil on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它需要你的批准才能在后台运行。点按以打开“登录项与扩展”，然后开启 Adrafinil。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It now lives in your menu bar. Close the lid while an agent is working — your Mac stays awake. No agent running? Sleep behaves normally." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它现在常驻在菜单栏中。智能体工作时合上盖子，Mac 会保持唤醒；没有智能体运行时，睡眠一切如常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It will install itself when your Mac is idle and no agents are working." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它会在 Mac 闲置且没有智能体工作时自动安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's fully open source —" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它完全开源——"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its Adrafinil hook changed, so your Mac might not stay awake while it works. Open Settings to reconnect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的 Adrafinil 钩子已被更改，因此它工作时 Mac 可能无法保持唤醒。打开设置以重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its background service isn't registered, so it can't keep your Mac awake. Repair it to register it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的后台服务未注册，因此无法让 Mac 保持唤醒。点“修复”以重新注册。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its background service isn't responding. Repair it to re-register and bring it back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的后台服务没有响应。点“修复”以重新注册并恢复运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its background service isn't set up. Tap to finish setting up Adrafinil." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的后台服务尚未设置。点按以完成 Adrafinil 的设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its background service stopped responding and couldn't repair itself. Tap to open Login Items & Extensions, remove Adrafinil, then reopen it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的后台服务已停止响应，且无法自行修复。点按以打开“登录项与扩展”，移除 Adrafinil，然后重新打开它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep awake" : {
