        }
      }
    },
    "Until you approve them in Codex with /hooks, your Mac won't stay awake while Codex works. Open Settings for the steps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你于 Codex 中用 /hooks 批准之前，Codex 工作时 Mac 不会保持唤醒。打开设置查看操作步骤。"
